 # Name inline extension factories for standalone distribution
 
 packages/cli/sandpiper_resources.ts's createSandpiperExtensionFactories() returns bare ExtensionFactory[], passed into main()'s extensionFactories in packages/cli/sandpiper_standalone.ts:80-91. Per Pi 0.80.4, unnamed inline factories show as <inline:1>, <inline:2>, etc. in the startup Extensions list. Wrap them as named InlineExtension objects ({ name, factory }) so the standalone distribution's extension list is readable for debugging. Depends on the 0.80.6 version bump subtask.
